2. **Should we keep `/platform/` URL structure, or migrate co-pilots to `/products/oncology/therapy-fit`?**
   - Option A: Keep `/platform/` (preserves existing URLs, SEO)
   - Option B: Migrate to `/products/oncology/` (clearer hierarchy, but requires redirects)

3. **How should Unified Care Plan be showcased?**
   - Option A: Separate section on Oncology product page
   - Option B: Integrated into each co-pilot page
   - Option C: Dedicated page `/products/oncology/care-plan`

